# Personal project-documentation exports (Word/PDF/HTML) -- these don't belong in the code
# repo: they're edited locally, periodically create Word's transient "~$..." lock file in
# git status, and a saved Google Docs HTML export embeds Google's own internal API keys,
# which triggered a GitHub secret-scanning alert once one such file got committed.
*.docx
*.doc
* - Google Docs.html
* - Google Docs.pdf
